				{
					"id": 413131101,
					"content": "到這裡為止吧。我就不陪你們進城了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131102,
						413131104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131102,
					"content": "等一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413131103,
					"content": "還有什麼事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131105,
					"content": "明明海燈節紀念的英雄裡也包括你…為什麼你卻不想去看燈呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131106,
					"content": "我…不喜歡人群。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131107,
					"content": "無憂無慮的，安逸的人群…我和他們不一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131108,
					"content": "我和殺戮並存太久，已經習慣了那種苦行。和幸福的人一起，只會讓我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131109,
					"content": "…這個話題到此為止吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131110,
					"content": "再會。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131111,
					"content": "真的不和我一起看燈嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413131112,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}這麼喜歡湊熱鬧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131113,
					"content": "你猜猜看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413131114,
					"content": "喂！這都是正當娛樂活動，不能說是湊熱鬧呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131115,
					"content": "…正當的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131116,
					"content": "#罷了。去看{F#妳}{M#你}的燈吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131117,
					"content": "但注意安全。遇到任何危險，就直呼我的名字吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131118,
					"content": "你又不在城裡，趕得過來嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413131119,
					"content": "隨時隨地。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131120,
					"content": "#不論是{F#妳}{M#你}，還是璃月。所有的燈火，所有祈求平安的願望，我都已經聽到了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 413131104,
					"content": "（…算了，在這裡就能看到。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413131105
					]
				}
			]
		},
